He grabbed my FedEx flat rate box, and then he started beating me with my FedEx flat rate box.

2
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:16,920
Now, I don't know if any of you have ever been beat with a FedEx flat rate box,

3
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:27,150
but you don't really realize what's happening until you about five beats in.

4
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:43,520
We're tussling with the box. We're tussling with the box.

5
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:52,120
